    thirdPartyItem6: 'Ko te kai a DeHub ake e kawe ana i te ataata ora, me te Livepeer hei hinga, a ka mau a Agora i nga ruma oro ora',
    thirdPartyItem9: '**MoonPay** *kāhore i te whakapā mai i te ETH me te USDC i te whakapāhikarohia, ko te NEAR Intents, deBridge me ngā whakapāhikarohia whakamua i te whakapā mai i te kaitiaki i te whakapāhikarohia e whakapā mai ai; kua kite ai ngā whakapāhikarohia i te whakapāhikarohia e whakapā mai ai.*',
    thirdPartyItem10: 'A, no te hono koe i ētahi atu pūkete pāpori, ka tukuna ngā pou e whiriwhiri ana koe ki aua papaaho mā te ratonga tuku, me Farcaster mā te kaihauturu e whakaae ana koe',
    doCollectItem1: 'Ko te tohu i hainahia e koe — he wāhitau īmēra, he tau waea rānei mēnā ka whiriwhiri koe i tētahi o aua huarahi, ka hoki mai te tuakiri a Google, Apple, Telegram rānei mēnā kua hainatia koe i roto i te pāpori, i te whakawhirinaki tūmatanui rānei o te passkey. Ko te tohu putea kaore e hoatu ki a maatau tetahi mea engari ko to wahitau a te iwi.',
    thirdPartyItem8: 'Ko nga tuhinga me nga pāpāho e tukuna ana e koe ki te whakatupuranga, ki te whakamaori, ki te tuhi, ki te whakakore ranei i te waahanga ka tukuna ki te kaiwhakarato e whakahaere ana, mo taua tono anake. Ko te kuputuhi tūmataiti — nga karere, nga whakautu me nga korerorero awhina — kaore e tukuna ki tetahi kaiwhakarato e tereina ana i te taumata koreutu i runga i nga mea e whiwhi ana.',
